  "interpretation": "Coverage reports the proportion of required facts for which the code-based evaluator could establish a determinate alignment. Precision, Recall, and F1 on Scorable Facts are calculated only over those determinate facts. Indeterminate facts are excluded rather than forced into TP or FN decisions.",
